                                "sense_id": "d461188f-6a7f-38ca-9c77-a45cf52f52af",
                                "text": "[I]t sank down through the air and poured over the ground in a manner rather liquid than gaseous, abandoning the hills, and streaming into the valleys and ditches and water-courses even as I have heard the carbonic acid gas that pours from volcanic clefts is wont to do."
